<p id="A3.SS1.SSS0.Px4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The transcripts are organized as follows:</p>
</div>
<div id="A3.SS1.SSS0.Px4.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A3.SS1.SSS0.Px4.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="195.08" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 195.08" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,195.08) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#404040;" fill="#404040" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.91 L 0 189.18 C 0 192.44 2.64 195.08 5.91 195.08 L 544.09 195.08 C 547.36 195.08 550 192.44 550 189.18 L 550 5.91 C 550 2.64 547.36 0 544.09 0 L 5.91 0 C 2.64 0 0 2.64 0 5.91 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F2F2F2;" fill="#F2F2F2" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 5.91 L 1.97 171.13 L 548.03 171.13 L 548.03 5.91 C 548.03 3.73 546.27 1.97 544.09 1.97 L 5.91 1.97 C 3.73 1.97 1.97 3.73 1.97 5.91 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 179.72)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.62em;--ltx-fo-height:0.68em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.15" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.46)" width="506.72"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A3.SS1.SSS0.Px4.p2.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.62em;">
<span id="A3.SS1.SSS0.Px4.p2.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SS1.SSS0.Px4.p2.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Transcripts</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 150.07)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.62em;--ltx-fo-height:0.67em;--ltx-fo-depth:9.85em;font-size:10pt;" height="145.54" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.24)" width="506.72"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A3.SS1.SSS0.Px4.p2.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.62em;">
<span id="A3.SS1.SSS0.Px4.p2.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SS1.SSS0.Px4.p2.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#ED2E68;">&lt;transcript&gt;
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A3.SS1.SSS0.Px4.p2.pic1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Here is the transcript of the debate:
<br class="ltx_break">Round 1: 
<br class="ltx_break">debater Alice: … 
<br class="ltx_break">debater Bob: … 
<br class="ltx_break">Round 2: 
<br class="ltx_break">debater Alice: … 
<br class="ltx_break">debater Bob: … 
<br class="ltx_break"></span>&lt;/transcript&gt;<span id="A3.SS1.SSS0.Px4.p2.pic1.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
</section>
</section>
</section>
